      "name": "t:our_approach.name",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "OUR APPROACH",
        "heading": "Connect Every WhatsApp Interaction to a Business Outcome.",
        "body_primary": "<p>Our approach starts with your business goals, target markets, and the conversations your customers actually have. We map those conversations to automated flows, the right approved templates, and the right team handoffs — then prioritize Cloud API setup, chat design, system integrations, and compliant campaign management.</p>",
        "body_secondary": "<p>You receive a clear roadmap, defined deliverables, and reporting tied to agreed goals. This keeps work focused on meaningful revenue outcomes and reduces wasted effort on disconnected messaging or risky campaign tactics.</p>",
